  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 593194,
    "RowId": 12101,
    "Text": "When ensemble mode is enabled, all party members will be heard in sync by players in the vicinity, but there will be a delay between the inputs and the sounds being heard by those performing, according to the playback type.\nThose who select “Self Only” will only hear their own instrument, while “All Members” plays the instruments of all members with an increased delay."
